    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/40f41a4e6c254ffc16800f3b2ba83b4d.avif?t=1750780570\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ritual Begins!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within a spooky dungeon, witches have set aside their cauldrons in favor of sizzling grills and toasted buns. The world craves the finest enchanted burgers, and only you and your coven can deliver! But beware\u2014meeting the quota is no easy feat. With orders piling up, ingredients flying, and time slipping away, teamwork is the only spell that will save you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/29548d18efac018ed972289c2c4503d7.poster.avif?t=1750780570\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/29548d18efac018ed972289c2c4503d7.webm?t=1750780570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/29548d18efac018ed972289c2c4503d7.mp4?t=1750780570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Burger Witch</i> blends cooperative chaos with a whimsical witchcraft twist. Take orders, assemble burgers with style, and serve mystical customers before time runs out. Earn gold to upgrade your tools, expand your kitchen, and prepare for even greater challenges. But remember\u2014witches cook with magic, not madness, so don\u2019t throw food (unless absolutely necessary)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to don your witch hat and master the mystical art of burger-making?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/3f9fa605a42e554ffc8fe635f04d7f60.avif?t=1750780570\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical Kitchen Madness</strong> \u2013 Work in a haunted dungeon-turned-burger-joint, where every round brings new challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/636a2956e90aad52e8e5f9fc080713cd.poster.avif?t=1750780570\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/636a2956e90aad52e8e5f9fc080713cd.webm?t=1750780570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/636a2956e90aad52e8e5f9fc080713cd.mp4?t=1750780570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Co-op Chaos</strong> \u2013 Team up with friends to cook, assemble, and serve enchanted burgers before the clock runs out!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Tools</strong> \u2013 Earn gold to enhance your kitchen, unlock new magical cooking gadgets, and improve efficiency.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/3480986f8290306e2bca592c4e4900e3.poster.avif?t=1750780570\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/3480986f8290306e2bca592c4e4900e3.webm?t=1750780570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/3480986f8290306e2bca592c4e4900e3.mp4?t=1750780570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Witchcraft Book</strong> \u2013 Follow the ancient (and slightly absurd) rules of mystical burger assembly. Style matters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whimsical Witchy Vibes</strong> \u2013 Spooky, charming, and filled with humor\u2014because even witches need to have fun in the kitchen.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/02cc1f9684dafd8a7767475958392b64.poster.avif?t=1750780570\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/02cc1f9684dafd8a7767475958392b64.webm?t=1750780570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/02cc1f9684dafd8a7767475958392b64.mp4?t=1750780570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The orders are in, the grill is hot, and the customers are waiting. <strong>Fire up the magic and start cooking\u2014before it\u2019s too late!</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/40f41a4e6c254ffc16800f3b2ba83b4d.avif?t=1750780570\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ritual Begins!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within a spooky dungeon, witches have set aside their cauldrons in favor of sizzling grills and toasted buns. The world craves the finest enchanted burgers, and only you and your coven can deliver! But beware\u2014meeting the quota is no easy feat. With orders piling up, ingredients flying, and time slipping away, teamwork is the only spell that will save you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/29548d18efac018ed972289c2c4503d7.poster.avif?t=1750780570\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/29548d18efac018ed972289c2c4503d7.webm?t=1750780570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/29548d18efac018ed972289c2c4503d7.mp4?t=1750780570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Burger Witch</i> blends cooperative chaos with a whimsical witchcraft twist. Take orders, assemble burgers with style, and serve mystical customers before time runs out. Earn gold to upgrade your tools, expand your kitchen, and prepare for even greater challenges. But remember\u2014witches cook with magic, not madness, so don\u2019t throw food (unless absolutely necessary)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to don your witch hat and master the mystical art of burger-making?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/3f9fa605a42e554ffc8fe635f04d7f60.avif?t=1750780570\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical Kitchen Madness</strong> \u2013 Work in a haunted dungeon-turned-burger-joint, where every round brings new challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/636a2956e90aad52e8e5f9fc080713cd.poster.avif?t=1750780570\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/636a2956e90aad52e8e5f9fc080713cd.webm?t=1750780570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/636a2956e90aad52e8e5f9fc080713cd.mp4?t=1750780570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Co-op Chaos</strong> \u2013 Team up with friends to cook, assemble, and serve enchanted burgers before the clock runs out!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Tools</strong> \u2013 Earn gold to enhance your kitchen, unlock new magical cooking gadgets, and improve efficiency.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/3480986f8290306e2bca592c4e4900e3.poster.avif?t=1750780570\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/3480986f8290306e2bca592c4e4900e3.webm?t=1750780570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/3480986f8290306e2bca592c4e4900e3.mp4?t=1750780570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Witchcraft Book</strong> \u2013 Follow the ancient (and slightly absurd) rules of mystical burger assembly. Style matters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whimsical Witchy Vibes</strong> \u2013 Spooky, charming, and filled with humor\u2014because even witches need to have fun in the kitchen.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/02cc1f9684dafd8a7767475958392b64.poster.avif?t=1750780570\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/02cc1f9684dafd8a7767475958392b64.webm?t=1750780570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552050/extras/02cc1f9684dafd8a7767475958392b64.mp4?t=1750780570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The orders are in, the grill is hot, and the customers are waiting. <strong>Fire up the magic and start cooking\u2014before it\u2019s too late!</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Magic meets mayhem in this frantic burger-crafting adventure! Assemble enchanted burgers, manage chaotic kitchen orders, and work with friends to meet your spooky quota before time runs out. Cook, cast, and conquer the kitchen\u2014because in this dungeon, witches don\u2019t brew potions, they grill patties!",
